        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is about surviving the zombie invasion, from your workplace to home, you will find trouble on your way home from office building, forest, mine and sewer. crafting and walk silently are necessary for your own survival, if the city is invaded, what about your home? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 chapters in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Your workplace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Mansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Forest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Mine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Sewer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does taking all these shortcuts make you safer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find out yourself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105610/extras/e332a1aeb91480ad1bd6a61bd186b486.avif?t=1762733786\" width=1024 height=1536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting items such as box and bushes will conceal yourself from getting exposed and killed by the enemies as long as you stay still when in camouflage, don't forget to gather crafting material in the workplace such as tape, cardboard, plants, branches, rope and knives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box and Bushes camouflage serve different purpose, players need to figure it out when and where to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a bow to stop the zombie in the mine from getting close and send it back to it's den, but it will return in some area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105610/extras/95020aa09e8d015f901b9b25251c8ef5.avif?t=1762733786\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is about surviving the zombie invasion, from your workplace to home, you will find trouble on your way home from office building, forest, mine and sewer. crafting and walk silently are necessary for your own survival, if the city is invaded, what about your home? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 chapters in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Your workplace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Mansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Forest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Mine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Sewer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does taking all these shortcuts make you safer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find out yourself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105610/extras/e332a1aeb91480ad1bd6a61bd186b486.avif?t=1762733786\" width=1024 height=1536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting items such as box and bushes will conceal yourself from getting exposed and killed by the enemies as long as you stay still when in camouflage, don't forget to gather crafting material in the workplace such as tape, cardboard, plants, branches, rope and knives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box and Bushes camouflage serve different purpose, players need to figure it out when and where to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a bow to stop the zombie in the mine from getting close and send it back to it's den, but it will return in some area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105610/extras/95020aa09e8d015f901b9b25251c8ef5.avif?t=1762733786\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
